[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16922.23, "timestamp": "04:42:02", "text": "什么？这边。我应该称之为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16923.91, "timestamp": "04:42:03", "text": "技能？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16924.99, "timestamp": "04:42:04", "text": "关闭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16930.99, "timestamp": "04:42:10", "text": "向上。这就是我做不到的原因。好的，是云。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16943.788, "timestamp": "04:42:23", "text": "F. 好的。把我们带到了入口处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16949.51, "timestamp": "04:42:29", "text": "哇。等等，这也太快了吧。你做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16952.43, "timestamp": "04:42:32", "text": "看。是的。这是我的入口"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16955.19, "timestamp": "04:42:35", "text": "城堡。过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16958.31, "timestamp": "04:42:38", "text": "瞧。当你建造城堡时，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16960.07, "timestamp": "04:42:40", "text": "我已经有一座城堡了。这是否，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16970.868, "timestamp": "04:42:50", "text": "好了，这就是参赛作品。快点。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16973.75, "timestamp": "04:42:53", "text": "它非常舒适小巧。 E，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16975.67, "timestamp": "04:42:55", "text": "有个头。什么？那是一条龙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16978.47, "timestamp": "04:42:58", "text": "那是一条龙。你必须战胜它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16979.83, "timestamp": "04:42:59", "text": "哦，糟糕。"}]